    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28263" root="عجن" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَجِينَةٌ</span></b> : see the next preceding paragraph, in
three places. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>A company, an assembly,</i>
or <i>an assemblage;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمَاعَةٌ</span>; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَعَجِّنَةٌ</span></b> 
[written by Freytag <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعْجِنَةٌ</span>]: or <i>such as is numerous.</i> (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُمُّ عَجِينَةَ</span> is an appellation of <i>The</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَخَمَة</span>, [or <i>female of the vultur percnopterus</i>]. (K,
TA.)

